# SPRITE SHEET PLACEHOLDER

This file will be replaced with the actual Gully sprite sheet once generated.

## Generation Instructions

1. Use the prompts in `art-prompts.md` to generate character art in Codex
2. Assemble frames into an 8x9 sprite sheet using hatch-pet skill
3. Replace this placeholder file with `gully-spritesheet.png`
4. The sprite sheet should be 1536x1872 pixels (8 columns × 9 rows, 192×208px cells)

